      "message": "test(app): keyed bar verifier pin and the microARC wrap golden\n\nThe keyed bar in bar stock verifies with no blocking finding but the\nkeyway corners' rest, which the single-frame path reports as well. The\nmicroARC test part's Rotary Parallel wrap golden is regenerated with\nWRITE_GOLDEN=1: its bottom band is now cut (3246 -> 2684 lines).\n\nRefs #2970\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
